<title>AUSTRIA: Iraq doubts one year OPEC output rollover.</title>
<headline>Iraq doubts one year OPEC output rollover.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Head of the Iraqi delegation Osama al-Hiti hiti said he doubted OPEC would decide on a one year OPEC output rollover.</p>
<p>&quot;I don't think so,&quot; he said when asked if a one year rollover was possible.</p>
</text>
